#: quickbook/specialAppInfoFakeDummyForL10nScript.php:3
msgid ""
"One-page appointment booking for Calendar schedules, without the email "
"confirmation step."
msgstr ""

#: quickbook/specialAppInfoFakeDummyForL10nScript.php:4
msgid ""
"Quick Booking adds a public booking page for the appointment schedules you "
"already have in the Calendar app. Requires the Calendar app.\n"
"\n"
"Visitors pick a date and time, enter their details, review and confirm on "
"the same page. The appointment is booked immediately and the usual booking "
"confirmation email (with .ics) is sent.\n"
"\n"
"* Share the usual Calendar booking link (\"Copy link\" in the Calendar app): "
"it opens Quick Booking.\n"
"* One-time appointment schedules: offer appointments on one or more chosen "
"dates (e.g. parent-teacher conferences) instead of weekly. Create them in "
"the Calendar app under \"One-time appointment schedules\".\n"
"* Built-in rate limiting of bookings per visitor and per email address.\n"
"* Self-check: verifies after every Calendar or Nextcloud update that it "
"still works, and lets the booking link show the standard Calendar booking "
"page when something breaks."
msgstr ""

