#: quickbook/templates/settings-admin.php:10
msgid "Quick Booking self-check"
msgstr ""

#: quickbook/templates/settings-admin.php:12
msgid ""
"Quick Booking uses internal code of the Calendar app. It checks after every "
"Calendar or Nextcloud update and once a day that this still works. If "
"something breaks, visitors are sent to the standard Calendar booking page "
"and admins get a notification. While switched off, the check repeats every "
"15 minutes and switches back on when it passes."
msgstr ""

#: quickbook/templates/settings-admin.php:17
msgid "Off: visitors use the standard Calendar booking page."
